Subject: [PATCH] Integrate checked source partial definitions

Reconciled with main ec6660ff. Preserve existing noncomputable isolation.
Both the opaque interface and recursive executable declaration go through
Engine::admit_declarations, which runs the existing two kernel checkers.
No kernel rule, resource limit, workflow, or authentication code changes.
Legacy single-declaration APIs refuse to silently drop required companions.
The native partial, module, noncomputable, and erasure regressions passed.

